claire: Quick prep for ClinicPilot POC. They need a single TLS websocket that multiplexes logical sessions, streaming tokens, in-stream action_call events (their name), strict JSON-schema output (they'll give schema_id), EU residency, customer KMS + SSO. Also want a 1-week ballpark for 500 QPS. Need runnable snippet + runbook + short legal blurb before tomorrow.

raj: We support multiplexing via session_id. action_call arrives as structured event `action_call` with {name,args}. Handler must respond with `action_result` JSON string. For ordering use Dedicated w/ sticky routing; hosted can rebalance. Ephemeral JWTs supported (we can set TTL to 5m for POC).

diego: Small Node example (copyable):
```js
// open WS, send schema_id, handle action_call
const ws=new WebSocket(process.env.POC_WS);
ws.on('open',()=>ws.send(JSON.stringify({type:'open',session_id:'s1',schema_id:'json:v2/patient'})));
ws.on('message',m=>{const msg=JSON.parse(m);
 if(msg.type==='action_call'){const res={ok:true,data:{id:msg.args.id}}; ws.send(JSON.stringify({type:'action_result',session_id:msg.session_id,call_id:msg.call_id,result:JSON.stringify(res)}));}});
```

raj: Handshake curl: `curl -X POST https://api.redwood.ai/handshake -H "Authorization: Bearer $RW_KEY" -d '{"session_id":"s1","schema_id":"json:v2/patient"}'` -> returns `{"ws_url":"wss://...","ephemeral_jwt":"...","expires_in":300}`. Use ephemeral_jwt as Bearer when connecting.

legal: Draft blurb: "Runtime keeps KV/cache in-memory for inference only; Dedicated/Private do not persist raw prompt/response tokens to disk unless logging is explicitly enabled by the customer. Customer-managed KMS is supported for any persisted artifacts. Audit logs for admin/provisioning available per contract."

raj: Short POC runbook: 1) Exchange IdP metadata + KMS ARN. 2) We provision EU Dedicated test pool (2-3 days) or Private (2-3 weeks). 3) POST /handshake -> ws_url + ephemeral_jwt. 4) Open single WS, multiplex with session_id, include schema_id. 5) On action_call call local adapter and respond with action_result JSON. Ensure idempotence. 6) Rotate/revoke ephemeral_jwt after demo.

diego: Ballpark for 500 QPS sustained (EU Dedicated test, one week): rough $26k-$46k depending on avg tokens and support level. Formal quote to follow.

